# Keep the build context small and free of anything secret.
# `docs/reference/` and `reference/` are deliberately outside version control
# (CLAUDE.md) but may exist on a developer's disk — never let them into a layer.
reference/
docs/reference/

.git/
.github/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/coverage/

# The same exclusions restated for `az acr build`, whose packer matches with
# fnmatch rather than Docker's normaliser. Two differences bite:
#   - `**/` never matches a nested path
#   - a trailing slash is not stripped, so `node_modules/` matches nothing
# Docker treats every line below as a duplicate of one above and ignores it.
#
# W21 measured the cost of assuming otherwise: the first upload died reading
# apps/web/.next/dev/lock (line 12's `**/.next/` unapplied), and the second
# stalled past fifteen minutes packing the 839 MB / 49,825-file root
# node_modules, which line 9 only excludes if the trailing slash is stripped.
node_modules
apps/*/node_modules
packages/*/node_modules
apps/*/dist
apps/*/.next
apps/*/coverage
docs
memory
scripts

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx

docs/
memory/
scripts/
*.md
